---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import avatarImg from '../assets/avatar.webp';
import { NAV_PILLARS, FOOTER_META_LINKS } from '../data/navigation';
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div class="footer-about">
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.6rem;">
          <Image src={avatarImg} alt="网络AI 头像" width={32} height={32} style="border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--border-strong);" loading="lazy" />
          <strong>网络AI · aiwangluounk.my</strong>
        </div>
        <p>
          中文网络服务与代理工具研究型知识库、31 家机场品牌结构化数据库与客观购买决策参考平台。坚持区分厂商宣称、历史归档与可验证实测数据。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-meta">
        <div class="footer-col-title">站点治理与透明度</div>
        <ul>
          {FOOTER_META_LINKS.map((item) => (
            <li><a href={item.href}>{item.title}</a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-pillars" aria-label="十大一级专题索引">
      {NAV_PILLARS.map((pillar) => (
        <div class="footer-pillar">
          <a href={pillar.href} class="footer-pillar__title">
            <span class="mono">{pillar.code}</span> {pillar.title}
          </a>
          <ul>
            {pillar.children.map((sub) => (
              <li><a href={sub.href}>{sub.title}</a></li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>
        © 2026 网络AI（aiwangluounk.my）。本站含部分商业推广链接，通过相关链接注册可能为本站带来佣金，不影响用户支付价格。所有技术教程与网络信息仅供合法合规用途与技术学习参考，请遵守所在地法律法规。
      </p>
      <p class="mono footer-feeds">
        <a href="/rss.xml">RSS 订阅</a> · <a href="/sitemap-index.xml">XML Sitemap</a> · <a href="/robots.txt">robots.txt</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    padding-block: 2.25rem 1.75rem;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .footer-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .footer-top {
      grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  .footer-about strong {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .footer-about p {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .footer-col-title {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .footer-meta ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem 1rem;
  }
  .footer-pillars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(175px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem 1rem;
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
  }
  .footer-pillar__title {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }
  .footer-pillar__title .mono {
    color: var(--brand-cyan);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
  }
  .footer-pillar ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.24rem;
  }
  .footer-pillar a {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .footer-pillar a:hover {
    color: var(--brand-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .footer-bottom {
    padding-top: 1.15rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .footer-bottom p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 82ch;
  }
  .footer-feeds {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
</style>
